   "description": "<div id=\"sparkled-assessment\"><div style=\"background:#0A1226; border-bottom:4px solid #FFB347; border-radius:10px; padding:18px 22px; margin-bottom:12px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px; color:#FFB347; margin-bottom:6px;\"><strong>MODULE REVIEW</strong></div><div style=\"font-family:'Old Standard TT',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif; font-size:26px; color:#FFFDF8; line-height:1.25; margin-bottom:6px;\">Module Review: The Cold War Turns Hot</div><div style=\"font-size:15px; color:#FFB347;\">Survey · 5 questions · not graded</div></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center; color:#FFB347; font-size:16px; margin:0 0 4px;\">◎ ─ ◎ ─ ◎</div>\n<div style=\"border-top:2px solid #B5440A; margin:0 0 16px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFFDF8; border:1px solid #E2D6C6; border-top:4px solid #0A1226; border-radius:12px; padding:18px 22px; margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"display:inline-block; background:#0A1226; color:#FFFDF8; font-size:12px; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:999px; margin-bottom:12px;\"><strong>Before you start</strong></div><p style=\"font-size:17px; color:#1B1A1A; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 0;\">You have reached the end of The Cold War Turns Hot. Answer the questions below. Your answers help your teacher see what the class understood and what needs more attention. This survey is not graded.</p></div>\n</div>",
